agm-0966: AGM H6 PMIC services: restart and power off through the SC2730
(PE_halt_restart), calendar from the PMIC RTC, and the SC2730 fuel gauge for
SweetBattery (voltage -> percent, current -> charging) instead of the static
fallback.

